# DEPENDENCIES

## Production dependencies (required for the app to run)
 npm i primeng@18.0.2                             ## Primeng for components
 npm i @primeng/themes@18.0.2                     ## Primeng themes
 npm i primeicons                                 ## Prime Icons
 npm i date-fns                                   ## Library for date and time
 npm i jwt-decode                                 ## Library for JWT decoding
 npm i @ngx-translate/core@16.0.4                 ## Library for internationalization (i18n)
 npm i @ngx-translate/http-loader@16.0.1          ## Library for translation http loader (i18n)


## Development dependencies. Use --save-dev (or -D) for packages not needed in the final production bundle.
 npm install --save-dev tailwindcss@3.4.17
 npm install --save-dev postcss@8.4.49
 npm install --save-dev autoprefixer@10.4.21



